  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>🌟CONQUER LAUNDRY DAY🌟</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp; <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"></span></span><strong>Join the Laundry Revolution</strong> with our Ultra-powerful Solid Enzyme Laundry Detergent <strong>which tackles both visible and invisible dirt</strong>. This ultra concentrated laundry detergent sheet delivers 15X heavy duty and long-lasting cleaning power after every wash cycle.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">🍃</span><b> 5-in-1 Formula </b>offers a Powerful laundry clean, removes tough stains, eliminate odors, protect colors, and hypoallergenic in one sheet. Our Laundry sheets remove bad smells and deep cleans bedding, towels, children&rsquo;s clothes, baby&rsquo;s clothes, underwear, gym clothes, pet beds.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">👶</span>Hypoallergenic</b>. VivaWash laundry sheets are kind to sensitive skin; hypoallergenic, <span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">🚫</span>bleach-free, dye-free, paraben-free, phosphate-free, phthalate-free, and certified cruelty-free. safe for sensitive skin, babies, and pets.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">🫧</span><b>Easy to Use</b>: Just simple remove sheet, place in drum and start your preferred laundry cycle. NO mess, NO measuring, NO wasted detergent.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">💧</span><b>Eco Friendly:</b> Prevent the heavy plastic jugs, pods, bottles from our oceans and landfills. Reduce plastic waste with our 100% biodegradable FSC certified packaging. Our organic laundry detergent sheets are made with <span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">💯</span>% natural plant-based ingredients and essential oils.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Emoji';\">🌎</span><b>Sustainable Choice</b>: Ditch the heavy plastic Jugs, and Harsh Chemicals and Make a difference with every load. Join us in preserving the environment, one wash at a time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">💖<strong>MAKE CLEANING A FORCE FOR GOOD</strong>💖</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">For every purchase, we donate a percentage to charitable causes that help make the planet fairer and safer, including tree planting, ocean cleanups and supporting underprivileged communities</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>With built-in stain removal, odor eliminator, color protection</strong>, our laundry detergent sheets eliminate the need for purchasing separate products for each issue, thereby reducing expenses💰. By preventing color bleeding, neutralizing odors, and ensuring pristine cleanliness💦, our detergent sheets preserve quality over time and prolong the lifespan of clothes🎉.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The sheets are <strong>easy to use</strong> and can be simply tossed into the washing machine along with your laundry❤️. They are also <strong>plastic-free, liquid less, biodegradable♻️, and environmentally friendly, making them a great choice for those who want to reduce their impact on the planet</strong>🌍.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>❤️Make your audience enjoy a powerful clean while making a huge impact❤️.</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Once a month through paypal and credit card</p>\r\n</div>",
